        "text_AHtUHA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>For drivers wanting a commanding stance and bigger tyres—100% legal Australia-wide (Pre-Rego only).</em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM Rating:</strong> 4000kg (Approx. 1519KG payload) | <strong>GCM:</strong> 8500kg</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> Fox 2.5 Performance Elite with BDS Lift Kit Technology (4-Inch Suspension Lift).</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Enthusiasts who want the functionality of a huge GVM and maximum legal payload, while retaining a 4.5T towing capacity and a massive on-road presence.</li><li><strong>The Benefit:</strong> The Stage 5 kit is federally recognised under our SSM approval. Because it is available Pre-Rego only, you can drive your lifted truck in any state, feeling safe, fully insured, and completely legal while looking the part.<br/><br/></li></ul>"
